B.VE=new A.ag("Is my video saved?","No. LangLoop uses peer-to-peer WebRTC \u2014 your video never touches our servers.")
B.Vm=new A.ag("How do I delete my account?","Go to Profile \u2192 Delete my account. Your data is anonymized within seconds.")
B.Vs=new A.ag("Why was I banned?","Bans happen after reports of abuse, nudity, or hate speech. If you believe this was a mistake, email support@langloop.app.")
